# Plugin API

Docs: `docs/plugins/api.md` (router to manifest, functions, features, host pages),
`docs/plugins/ui-contract.md`, schemas in `docs/plugins/schema/`, example
`docs/plugins/examples/media-card.md`.

## Versions

- `PLUGIN_HOST_API_VERSION = PLUGIN_MIN_API_VERSION = 4` (`plugin/api/PluginManifest.kt`). Alpha:
  only the current contract is accepted; no compatibility shims for older plugins.
- Optional `updates` capability: `checkUpdates(works)` → `PluginUpdateInfo[]`, used by the
  background new-chapter check (`plugin/updates/`); without it the host calls `loadWork`.
- `auth.web { url, doneCookie }`: in-app browser sign-in (`ui/plugin/WebLoginOverlay.kt`), cookies
  imported via `PluginCookieJar.import`; `lists[].notifyDefault` feeds `UpdateDiff.notifyLists`.
- Browse lists: `lists[].kind = "browse"` + `browse(id, page, sort, tab)` → `PluginBrowsePage`
  (`ui/plugin/PluginBrowse.kt`, `CreatorPage.kt`). Rows only (no books); excluded from notify lists,
  the update checker, and story `listedIn`. Entry pages have `tabs`; each tab is text, story
  (`storyId`), or items, loaded on first view and kept while open. Text tabs add `sections`;
  `Work.group` drives `groupedRows` headers; badges may be `{label, tone}` (`PluginTone` →
  `FlowBadgeTone`), persisted in membership rows via `PluginJson.badgesToJson`.
- Two-way sync (`plugin/sync/`): `syncable` lists and positions; optional `readPositions(works)` →
  `PluginReadPosition[]` (progressSync); `setMembership(..., false)` removes on the site;
  `flow.fetch(url, { cookies: false })` uses `PluginHttp`'s cookie-less client.
- `ChapterRef.locked` persists as a third `toc.txt` column; downloads skip locked chapters.
- ToC refresh reconciles by chapter URL (`PluginSessionStore.chapterMoves` / `reconcileChapterFiles`).

## Media card

- Plugins fill slots only: `card.stats` (≤6), `badges` (≤4), `links` (≤3, http(s)),
  `actions` (≤2 rail, ≤2 footer). Caps enforced in `PluginCard.capped()`.
- Host actions are fixed and ordered: list toggles, Share (rail); Download, Refresh, Delete, Read
  (footer). Reserved ids: `read download refresh delete share open remove notify` and `list:*`.
- Plugin actions → `PluginSource.cardAction(workId, actionId, on?)` → `PluginCardActionResult`
  (`card` patch persisted by `PluginBookStore.runCardAction`, `toast`, `reload`).
- Icon tokens (`FlowIcons.tokens`) are append-only API.

## When changing plugin-visible behavior

1. Update models/parsers in `plugin/api/PluginModels.kt` and tests in `app/src/test/.../plugin/api/`.
2. Update `MediaCardAdapters.kt` + `MediaCardAdaptersTest`.
3. Follow `docs/agent/cross-repo.md` (version sync, contract docs, host mirror, release order).

Where to edit: `docs/agent/map.md` `## plugins`. History and open threads:
`../flow-reader-chats/areas/plugins.md`.
